/target
.scratch

# This repo's own block, under the marker of `rex init`, so `rex init` here
# adds no block of its own. Unlike that block it keeps `.claude/skills/`,
# `.claude/agents/` and `.rex/skills/` in Git: they are the source of the
# bundle. `!/.rex/` wins over an ignore of all of `.rex/` in a checkout's own
# exclude file.
# rex:ignore superrex
.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/worktrees/
!/.rex/
/.rex/*
!/.rex/skills/
